sequenceDiagram
    participant API as Order API
    participant Facade as OrderFacadeImpl
    participant Event as OrderStatusChangedEvent
    participant Listener as OrderStatusSmsListener
    participant Provider as SmsProvider
    API->>Facade: update order status
    Facade->>Facade: persist status and history
    Facade->>Event: publish after persisted transition
    Event-->>Listener: async event delivery
    Listener->>Listener: filter SHIPPED / DELIVERED; choose phone
    Listener->>Provider: send order reference and status
    Note over Provider: Default provider is unconfigured; no real SMS is sent in tests
